    {"View Ipatches and dump the unpatched and patched versions\nof BootROM.\nOr dump every single key via #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", {"View Ipatches and dump the unpatched and patched versions\nof BootROM.\nOr dump every single key via #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", "Afficher les correctifs Ipatch et exporter les versions d'origine et corrigée\nde BootROM.\nOu exporter toutes les clés avec #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", "Ver los parches Ipatch y exportar las versiones original y corregida\nde BootROM.\nO exportar todas las claves con #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", "Visualizza le patch Ipatch ed esporta le versioni originale e corretta\ndi BootROM.\nOppure esporta tutte le chiavi con #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", "Просмотр Ipatch и сохранение исходной и исправленной версий\nBootROM.\nИли сохраните все ключи через #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n", "Ipatches anzeigen und ursprüngliche sowie korrigierte Versionen sichern\ndes BootROM.\nOder alle Schlüssel mit #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM# sichern.\n", "Ver correções Ipatch e exportar as versões original e corrigida\nde BootROM.\nOu exportar todas as chaves com #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n"}},
    {"View Ipatches and dump the unpatched and patched versions\nof BootROM. Or dump every single key via #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin is missing or old!#\n", {"View Ipatches and dump the unpatched and patched versions\nof BootROM. Or dump every single key via #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin is missing or old!#\n", "Afficher les correctifs Ipatch et exporter les versions d'origine et corrigée\nde BootROM. Ou exporter toutes les clés avec #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin est absent ou ancien !#\n", "Ver los parches Ipatch y exportar las versiones original y corregida\nde BootROM. O exportar todas las claves con #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin falta o es antiguo.#\n", "Visualizza le patch Ipatch ed esporta le versioni originale e corretta\ndi BootROM. Oppure esporta tutte le chiavi con #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin manca o è obsoleto.#\n", "Просмотр Ipatch и сохранение исходной и исправленной версий\nBootROM. Или сохраните все ключи через #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin отсутствует или устарел!#\n", "Ipatches anzeigen und ursprüngliche sowie korrigierte Versionen sichern\ndes BootROM. Oder alle Schlüssel mit #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM# sichern.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin fehlt oder ist veraltet!#\n", "Ver correções Ipatch e exportar as versões original e corrigida\nde BootROM. Ou exportar todas as chaves com #C7EA46 Lockpick RCM#.\n#FFDD00 bootloader/payloads/Lockpick_RCM.bin está ausente ou desatualizado!#\n"}},
