    {"Welcome to #C7EA46 emuMMC# creation tool!\n\nPlease choose what type of emuMMC you want to create.\n#FF8000 SD File# is saved as files in the FAT partition.\n#FF8000 SD Partition# is saved as raw image in an available partition.", {"Welcome to #C7EA46 emuMMC# creation tool!\n\nPlease choose what type of emuMMC you want to create.\n#FF8000 SD File# is saved as files in the FAT partition.\n#FF8000 SD Partition# is saved as raw image in an available partition.", "Création d'#C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nChoisir le type d'emuMMC à créer.\nLe mode Fichiers SD utilise la partition FAT.\nLe mode #FF8000 Partition SD# utilise une image brute dans une partition disponible.", "Creación de #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nElige el tipo de emuMMC que quieres crear.\nEl modo Archivos SD usa la partición FAT.\nEl modo #FF8000 Partición SD# usa una imagen sin procesar en una partición disponible.", "Creazione #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nScegliere il tipo di emuMMC da creare.\nLa modalità #FF8000 File SD# usa la partizione FAT.\nLa modalità #FF8000 Partizione SD# usa un'immagine grezza in una partizione disponibile.", "Создание #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nВыберите тип создаваемой emuMMC.\nФайловый режим SD использует раздел FAT.\nРежим раздела SD хранит сырой образ в доступном разделе.", "#C7EA46 emuMMC# erstellen\n\nTyp der zu erstellenden emuMMC wählen.\n#FF8000 SD-Datei#en werden in der FAT-Partition gespeichert.\n#FF8000 SD-Partition# speichert ein Rohabbild in einer freien Partition.", "Criação de #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nEscolhe o tipo de emuMMC a criar.\nO modo Ficheiros SD usa a partição FAT.\nO modo #FF8000 Partição SD# usa uma imagem bruta numa partição disponível."}},
    {"Welcome to #C7EA46 emuMMC# migration tool!\n\nPlease choose what type of migration you want to do.\nAnything that was not found will have the button disabled.", {"Welcome to #C7EA46 emuMMC# migration tool!\n\nPlease choose what type of migration you want to do.\nAnything that was not found will have the button disabled.", "Migration d'#C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nChoisir le type de migration.\nLes boutons des éléments absents seront désactivés.", "Migración de #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nElige el tipo de migración.\nLos botones de elementos ausentes estarán desactivados.", "Migrazione #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nScegliere il tipo di migrazione.\nI pulsanti degli elementi assenti saranno disattivati.", "Перенос #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nВыберите тип переноса.\nКнопки отсутствующих элементов будут отключены.", "#C7EA46 emuMMC# migrieren\n\nMigrationstyp wählen.\nSchaltflächen fehlender Elemente werden deaktiviert.", "Migração de #C7EA46 emuMMC#\n\nEscolhe o tipo de migração.\nOs botões dos elementos ausentes serão desativados."}},
